msgstr ""
"А сross-platform library for working with EyePoint devices. The library is written "
"in C, distributed as binary files (win32, win64, debian) and as source codes. The "
"library documentation can be downloaded separately on this page."

#: ../data/download.py:135
msgid "Примеры использования API и биндинги для Python и C#"
msgstr "Examples of using the API and bindings for Python and C#"

#: ../data/download.py:138
msgid ""
"Комплект примеров программного кода на языках C, C# и Python для устройствах линейки "
"EyePoint. Также в данном архиве можно найти биндинги для языков Python и C#."
msgstr ""
"A set of code examples in C, C# and Python for EyePoint devices. You can also find "
"bindings for Python and C# in this archive."

